==============================================================================
Changes made by The See-through Authors
==============================================================================

* The UNet was fine-tuned from Animagine XL 4.0 with the LayerDiffuse
  attention weights merged in, and converted into the multi-frame UNet
  (UNetFrameConditionModel) used by the See-through pipeline.
* The transparent VAE was derived from the LayerDiffuse transparent VAE.
* All components were saved in the diffusers format.
* The weights were quantised to 4-bit NF4 with bitsandbytes (bfloat16 compute
  dtype), starting from layerdifforg/seethroughv0.0.2_layerdiff3d. The UNet and both text
  encoders are quantised; the VAE and the transparent VAE are unchanged.

